{"audio": "narracion.mp3", "duracion": 63.87, "escenas": [{"ini": 0.0, "fin": 5.22, "texto": "A Bruno se le vara el carro en plena vía. ¿Lo arregla él, o llama al mecánico?", "palabras": [{"w": "A", "ini": 0.0, "fin": 0.16}, {"w": "Bruno", "ini": 0.16, "fin": 0.4}, {"w": "se", "ini": 0.4, "fin": 0.68}, {"w": "le", "ini": 0.68, "fin": 0.87}, {"w": "vara", "ini": 0.87, "fin": 1.06}, {"w": "el", "ini": 1.06, "fin": 1.2}, {"w": "carro", "ini": 1.2, "fin": 1.5}, {"w": "en", "ini": 1.5, "fin": 1.74}, {"w": "plena", "ini": 1.74, "fin": 2.12}, {"w": "vía.", "ini": 2.12, "fin": 2.48}, {"w": "¿Lo", "ini": 2.92, "fin": 3.1}, {"w": "arregla", "ini": 3.1, "fin": 3.46}, {"w": "él,", "ini": 3.46, "fin": 3.8}, {"w": "o", "ini": 3.8, "fin": 4.24}, {"w": "llama", "ini": 4.24, "fin": 4.56}, {"w": "al", "ini": 4.56, "fin": 4.7}, {"w": "mecánico?", "ini": 4.7, "fin": 5.22}]}, {"ini": 5.86, "fin": 10.64, "texto": "La primera vez, abre el capó, aprieta una tuerca… y el carro arranca.", "palabras": [{"w": "La", "ini": 5.86, "fin": 5.94}, {"w": "primera", "ini": 5.94, "fin": 6.2}, {"w": "vez,", "ini": 6.2, "fin": 6.62}, {"w": "abre", "ini": 6.62, "fin": 7.12}, {"w": "el", "ini": 7.12, "fin": 7.26}, {"w": "capó,", "ini": 7.26, "fin": 7.72}, {"w": "aprieta", "ini": 8.08, "fin": 8.42}, {"w": "una", "ini": 8.42, "fin": 8.58}, {"w": "tuerca…", "ini": 8.58, "fin": 9.02}, {"w": "y", "ini": 9.02, "fin": 9.68}, {"w": "el", "ini": 9.68, "fin": 9.84}, {"w": "carro", "ini": 9.84, "fin": 10.1}, {"w": "arranca.", "ini": 10.1, "fin": 10.64}]}, {"ini": 11.1, "fin": 15.5, "texto": "Eso es autorregulación: el problema se corrigió desde adentro.", "palabras": [{"w": "Eso", "ini": 11.1, "fin": 11.46}, {"w": "es", "ini": 11.46, "fin": 11.78}, {"w": "autorregulación:", "ini": 11.78, "fin": 12.82}, {"w": "el", "ini": 13.3, "fin": 13.44}, {"w": "problema", "ini": 13.44, "fin": 13.84}, {"w": "se", "ini": 13.84, "fin": 14.1}, {"w": "corrigió", "ini": 14.1, "fin": 14.68}, {"w": "desde", "ini": 14.68, "fin": 14.88}, {